  "text": "This outfit works for you because it plays on your defined waist and vertical line, letting the pink top follow your narrow shoulders and the plaid shorts highlight your hips without adding bulk. The red headband adds a soft pop that matches your makeup's low-contrast vibe while the brown boots and crossbody bag keep your look grounded for an autumn office day. The pink belt ties everything together smoothly over the shorts.",
  "how_to_wear": [
    "Keep the silk blouse untucked so the fabric falls freely over your hips, letting the waistband of the shorts define your shape instead."
